<metadata><name>Day 36 - Cam Snell, Isabel East, Glen Cross</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.992646" lon="-80.047917"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Parking lot on east side of 3rd Line EHS provides access to Glen Cross Side Trail. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.992043" lon="-80.049647"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the Glen Cross Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed Isabel East Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.993071" lon="-80.057525"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.993577" lon="-80.058777"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the main Bruce Trail, heading west. (the blue-blazed Cam Snell Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.996434" lon="-80.061388"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Cam Snell Side Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.988534" lon="-80.060902"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Isabel East Side Trail, heading south-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
